  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"----------jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:132px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%B8%88.jpg\" title=\"摄影师.jpg (120 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:132px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/1/19/%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%B8%88.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20251024095337&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"摄影师.jpg (120 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"摄影师.jpg\" data-image-key=\"%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%B8%88.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"摄影师.jpg (120 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"摄影师.jpg\" data-image-key=\"%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%B8%88.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/1/19/%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E5%B8%88.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/132?cb=20251024095337&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】摄影师\n</p><p>【初始区域】神社/学校\n</p><p>【禁行区域】无\n</p><p>【不安限度】 3\n</p><p>【属性】 学生·少女\n</p><p>【特性】如果该角色带有无视友好特性，则该角色也获得傀儡无视友好特性\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好3 1L1）同区域只有另1名角色时才可以发动，如果那名角色带有无视友好特性，那名角色死亡，否则该角色死亡。\n</p><p>（友好4）将该角色移动到远方，或将该角色从远方移动到任意版图\n</p><p>【感想】　从零系列而来的摄影师，说不定照相机才是本体\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260926161612\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expi